From: AVPcraft <noreply@avpcraft.local>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:40:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Lower the head-locked in-world HUD by 15 degrees

Consume hudPitchOffset for the no-screen head HUD. Rotate its position and
orientation together around the head-local right axis, preserving distance
and scale. Leave menus, inventory, wrist/hand and seated alternate aim alone.
Use HEAD, 2m, 0.8 scale and -15 degrees as new-profile defaults. Existing
profile values remain available for the host migration or user choice.
